## Integração obrigatória no plugin

### Module Federation (padrão — todo MFE novo)

Checklist completo: [novo-plugin-mfe-checklist.md](../docs/05-plugin-system/novo-plugin-mfe-checklist.md).

Helper: `plugins/vite/federation.shared.ts` + `plugins/vite/federationShareScope.ts`

```ts
// vite.config.ts
remotes: pluginUiRemote(),
shared: { ...FEDERATION_SHARED_REACT },
// federation() ANTES de react()
```

```ts
// bootstrap.tsx — antes de qualquer render React
import { preparePluginUiRemote } from "../../vite/federationShareScope";
await preparePluginUiRemote();
```

```ts
// imports de componentes
import { HelpTooltip } from "@delpi/plugin-ui/index";
```

Docker: **sem** `COPY plugin-ui`; `COPY vite ./vite`; container `delpi-plugin-ui` + `<<: *plugin-ui-federated` no compose.

### Bundled — `@delpi/tv-dashboard-presentation` (tv-dashboard, public-hub)

#### 1. Alias Vite

```ts
"@delpi/tv-dashboard-presentation": path.resolve(__dirname, "../tv-dashboard-presentation/src/index.ts"),
```

#### 2. Docker

`COPY tv-dashboard-presentation/` no Dockerfile ou `FROM delpi-plugins-shared-builder`.

#### 3. Tokens no dashboard

```css
.dashboard-{nome} {
  --delpi-ui-accent: var(--{prefix}-accent, var(--primary, #089bdb));
  --delpi-ui-surface: var(--{prefix}-surface, var(--surface, #fff));
  --delpi-ui-text: var(--{prefix}-text, var(--text, #111));
  --delpi-ui-border: var(--{prefix}-border, var(--border, #e5e7eb));
  --delpi-ui-muted: var(--{prefix}-muted);
}
```

#### 4. Textos PT-BR

Ficam em `src/content/helpTooltips.ts` **do plugin** — nunca hardcoded no pacote compartilhado.

#### 5. Docker (bundled — só `@delpi/tv-dashboard-presentation`)

Plugins que bundlam biblioteca irmã (`tv-dashboard`, `public-hub`):

1. `COPY tv-dashboard-presentation/` no Dockerfile (ou `FROM delpi-plugins-shared-builder`)
2. Compose **`context: ../plugins`**
3. Gate CI: `python3 scripts/ci/check_plugin_docker_shared_libraries.py --check`

Consumidor de **`@delpi/plugin-ui`**: ver [novo-plugin-mfe-checklist.md](../docs/05-plugin-system/novo-plugin-mfe-checklist.md) — MF, sem `COPY plugin-ui`.

